# "Activate only if you control an artifact" (CR 602.5b): with no artifact of its own the any-color ability is not
# offered even though Bot2's Mox Ruby sits untapped - only the controller's artifacts count. The {C} ability has no
# condition and still taps.

[Bot1 Deck]
Spire of Industry
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Spire of Industry.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Spire of Industry.Activate(Ability: any color; Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Spire of Industry.Activate(Ability: {C})
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
? Bot1.Life = 20
? Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Tapped = false

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Spire of Industry.Tapped = true
Bot1.Life = 20
